---
title: Master Orchestrator Sequence
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 👤 User
    participant CLI as 🖥️ CLI Interface
    participant MO as 🎼 Master<br/>Orchestrator
    participant IR as 🧭 Intent<br/>Router
    participant DoR as ✅ DoR Approval<br/>Gate
    participant Spec as 📋 Spec<br/>Loader
    participant TDD as 🧪 TDD<br/>Orchestrator
    participant AC as 📊 Audit<br/>Logger
    
    User->>CLI: Enter command:<br/>/implement feature_name
    CLI->>MO: route_request(request)
    MO->>AC: log_operation(AC_START)
    
    MO->>IR: classify_intent(request)
    IR-->>MO: IntentType.IMPLEMENT
    
    MO->>Spec: load_specifications()
    Spec-->>MO: SpecificationSet
    
    MO->>DoR: evaluate_dor(intent, spec)
    DoR->>DoR: LENS synthesis<br/>Language, Exam, Nav, Synth
    DoR-->>MO: IntentReflection
    
    MO->>CLI: display_dor(reflection)
    CLI->>User: Show DoR table<br/>and request approval
    
    User->>CLI: respond: "proceed"
    CLI->>MO: approval_response(approved=true)
    
    MO->>AC: log_operation(AC_EXECUTE)
    
    MO->>TDD: execute_workflow(intent)
    
    TDD->>TDD: Phase 1:<br/>Create test skeleton
    TDD->>TDD: Phase 2:<br/>Write failing tests
    TDD->>TDD: Phase 3:<br/>Implement feature
    TDD->>TDD: Phase 4:<br/>Run & validate
    TDD->>TDD: Phase 5:<br/>Refactor & optimize
    
    TDD-->>MO: ImplementationResult
    
    MO->>AC: log_operation(AC_COMPLETE,<br/>status=success)
    
    MO->>CLI: format_response(result)
    CLI->>User: Display results<br/>- Files created<br/>- Tests passed<br/>- Next steps
    
    alt User wants to continue
        User->>CLI: Next command
        CLI->>MO: New request
        Note over MO: Cycle repeats<br/>with new intent
    else User wants to review
        User->>CLI: /review
        CLI->>MO: review_request
        MO->>Spec: load_review_agents
        Spec-->>MO: ReviewAgentSet
        Note over MO: Review agents<br/>analyze work
    end
